    title: "scss and svelte: a reference to a mixin or import declared later (a later-sorted .scss file, a <script> after the markup) is emitted unresolved, because the registry is filled during the walk that reads it"  # 0cc2
    status: todo_hard  # 0cc2
    priority: 3  # 0cc2
    parent:  # 0cc2
